cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "PEAL: PyTorch Explain and Adapt Library"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper corresponding to the method you used. The projects were supervised by Marco Morik, Grégoire Montavon and Klaus-Robert Müller (listed as supervisors in the Zenodo record)."
